--- !u!114 &374616745
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 374616742}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 21b8d2e01c88a43ebb40163b26a7b965, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Micah
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38c96be720b34148990833d95d60e31, type: 3}
      line: Shelldon c-me her-. I s-ved y-u a sea-.
    - character:
        name: Shelldon
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df503ea0d1a24443e88c736620b50830, type: 3}
      line: (He looks over to where the voice is coming from) Oh hi Micah, I come.
    - character:
        name: Micah
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38c96be720b34148990833d95d60e31, type: 3}
      line: 'So, t-ll me ab-ut the oc-an. It se-m li-e a very int-rest-ng pl-ce to
        live. '
    - character:
        name: Shelldon
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df503ea0d1a24443e88c736620b50830, type: 3}
      line: The ocean is big and blue. There lots of different people and they nice
        too.
    - character:
        name: Micah
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38c96be720b34148990833d95d60e31, type: 3}
      line: R-aly? So w-y did y-u m-ve her-?
    - character:
        name: Shelldon
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df503ea0d1a24443e88c736620b50830, type: 3}
      line: My mom live here and my dad get new job with more pay so it make sense
        to move.
    - character:
        name: Micah
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38c96be720b34148990833d95d60e31, type: 3}
      line: "Ooo th-t\u2019s awes-me. Are you l-ki-g the su-face so far? "
    - character:
        name: Shelldon
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df503ea0d1a24443e88c736620b50830, type: 3}
      line: It a bit scary because of big buildings but it nice.
    - character:
        name: Micah
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38c96be720b34148990833d95d60e31, type: 3}
      line: "D-n\u2019t wo-ry! Y-u\u2019ll get u-ed to it. I ha-e an app-e for l-nch.
        Do y-u wa-t a bite?"
    - character:
        name: Shelldon
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df503ea0d1a24443e88c736620b50830, type: 3}
      line: Yes, I like apples.
    - character:
        name: Micah
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38c96be720b34148990833d95d60e31, type: 3}
      line: Ok, here tak- a bi-e.
    - character:
        name: Shelldon
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df503ea0d1a24443e88c736620b50830, type: 3}
      line: Oh ok. Do you want to play tic-tac-toe?
    - character:
        name: Micah
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f38c96be720b34148990833d95d60e31, type: 3}
      line: "Sure. I\u2019- rea-ly go-d at it."
  collidedIcon: 0
